DECLARATION_JSON {"axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"],"kind":"theorem","name":"RiffleLowerV2.Localization.prefix_event_cold_bounds","type":"∀ {k N K : ℕ} (cuts : TimeProfile.Cuts k N K) (hN : 0 < N),\n  2 ≤ N →\n    ∀ {T eta rho chi xi : ℝ},\n      0 < T →\n        0 < eta →\n          ∀ (P : TimeProfile.BorelPartition k) (W : RiffleLowerV2.ColdWitnessData)\n            (G : RiffleLowerV2.ColdGeometryData K P W),\n            RiffleLowerV2.WitnessSpec cuts hN eta rho chi W →\n              RiffleLowerV2.GeometrySpec cuts hN eta rho chi xi P W G →\n                ↑K ≤ T * TimeProfile.logScale N →\n                  4 * ↑k * T * TimeProfile.logScale N + 4 ≤ ↑N ^ (RiffleLowerV2.kappa eta / 4) →\n                    4 ≤ ↑N ^ (RiffleLowerV2.kappa eta / 2) →\n                      16 ≤ ↑N ^ (5 * RiffleLowerV2.kappa eta / 2) →\n                        ∀ (omega : RiffleLowerV2.Sample cuts),\n                          RiffleLowerV2.allPrefixEvent (RiffleLowerV2.kappa eta / 4) omega →\n                            have b := RiffleLowerV2.beta cuts hN (W.s N);\n                            have e := RiffleLowerV2.Localization.endpointError N k K (RiffleLowerV2.kappa eta) b;\n                            (∀ x ∈ RiffleLowerV2.coldPrefixFamily cuts hN P W G,\n                                |↑(RiffleLowerV2.relativeLowerCount G.ambient W.ms W.mu x omega) -\n                                        RiffleLowerV2.prefixMean cuts (RiffleLowerV2.prefixAt W.ms G.ambient) *\n                                          RiffleLowerV2.relativeMassBefore cuts x| +\n                                    |↑(RiffleLowerV2.relativeUpperCount G.ambient W.ms W.mu x omega) -\n                                        RiffleLowerV2.prefixMean cuts (RiffleLowerV2.prefixAt W.ms G.ambient) *\n                                          (RiffleLowerV2.relativeMassBefore cuts x + RiffleLowerV2.massOn cuts x)| ≤\n                                  e) ∧\n                              ∀ x ∈ RiffleLowerV2.coldPrefixFamily cuts hN P W G,\n                                e + 2 ≤\n                                    ↑(RiffleLowerV2.prefixCount (RiffleLowerV2.reservePrefix G x G.reserveMinus)\n                                        omega) ∧\n                                  e + 2 ≤\n                                    ↑(RiffleLowerV2.prefixCount (RiffleLowerV2.reservePrefix G x G.reservePlus) omega)","type_dependencies":["Nat","TimeProfile.Cuts","LT.lt","instLTNat","OfNat.ofNat","instOfNatNat","LE.le","instLENat","Real","Real.instLT","Zero.toOfNat0","Real.instZero","TimeProfile.BorelPartition","RiffleLowerV2.ColdWitnessData","RiffleLowerV2.ColdGeometryData","RiffleLowerV2.WitnessSpec","RiffleLowerV2.GeometrySpec","Real.instLE","Nat.cast","Real.instNatCast","HMul.hMul","instHMul","Real.instMul","TimeProfile.logScale","HAdd.hAdd","instHAdd","Real.instAdd","instOfNatAtLeastTwo","Nat.instAtLeastTwoHAddOfNat","Nat.instNeZeroSucc","HPow.hPow","instHPow","Real.instPow","HDiv.hDiv","instHDiv","DivInvMonoid.toDiv","Real.instDivInvMonoid","RiffleLowerV2.kappa","RiffleLowerV2.Sample","RiffleLowerV2.allPrefixEvent","RiffleLowerV2.beta","RiffleLowerV2.ColdWitnessData.s","RiffleLowerV2.Localization.endpointError","And","RiffleLowerV2.WordOn","RiffleLowerV2.prefixColumns","Membership.mem","Finset","SetLike.instMembership","Finset.instSetLike","RiffleLowerV2.coldPrefixFamily","abs","Real.lattice","Real.instAddGroup","HSub.hSub","instHSub","Real.instSub","RiffleLowerV2.relativeLowerCount","RiffleLowerV2.ColdGeometryData.ambient","RiffleLowerV2.ColdWitnessData.ms","RiffleLowerV2.ColdWitnessData.mu","RiffleLowerV2.prefixMean","RiffleLowerV2.prefixAt","RiffleLowerV2.relativeMassBefore","RiffleLowerV2.relativeUpperCount","RiffleLowerV2.massOn","RiffleLowerV2.prefixCount","RiffleLowerV2.reservePrefix","RiffleLowerV2.ColdGeometryData.reserveMinus","RiffleLowerV2.ColdGeometryData.reservePlus"],"value":"","value_dependencies":["Nat","TimeProfile.Cuts","LT.lt","instLTNat","OfNat.ofNat","in