DECLARATION_JSON {"axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"],"kind":"definition","name":"RiffleLowerV2.Localization.bridge_grid_cost_bounds.match_1_2","type":"∀ {k N K : ℕ} (cuts : TimeProfile.Cuts k N K) (hN : 0 < N) {mu bl : ℕ}\n  (motive :\n    0 ≤ RiffleLowerV2.J cuts hN 2 (RiffleLowerV2.gridTime N mu) (RiffleLowerV2.gridTime N (mu + bl)) ∧\n        RiffleLowerV2.J cuts hN 2 (RiffleLowerV2.gridTime N mu) (RiffleLowerV2.gridTime N (mu + bl)) ≤\n          (RiffleLowerV2.gridTime N (mu + bl) - RiffleLowerV2.gridTime N mu) * Real.log ↑k →\n      Prop)\n  (x :\n    0 ≤ RiffleLowerV2.J cuts hN 2 (RiffleLowerV2.gridTime N mu) (RiffleLowerV2.gridTime N (mu + bl)) ∧\n      RiffleLowerV2.J cuts hN 2 (RiffleLowerV2.gridTime N mu) (RiffleLowerV2.gridTime N (mu + bl)) ≤\n        (RiffleLowerV2.gridTime N (mu + bl) - RiffleLowerV2.gridTime N mu) * Real.log ↑k),\n  (∀ (hj0 : 0 ≤ RiffleLowerV2.J cuts hN 2 (RiffleLowerV2.gridTime N mu) (RiffleLowerV2.gridTime N (mu + bl)))\n      (hjle :\n        RiffleLowerV2.J cuts hN 2 (RiffleLowerV2.gridTime N mu) (RiffleLowerV2.gridTime N (mu + bl)) ≤\n          (RiffleLowerV2.gridTime N (mu + bl) - RiffleLowerV2.gridTime N mu) * Real.log ↑k),\n      motive ⋯) →\n    motive x","type_dependencies":["Nat","TimeProfile.Cuts","LT.lt","instLTNat","OfNat.ofNat","instOfNatNat","And","LE.le","Real","Real.instLE","Zero.toOfNat0","Real.instZero","RiffleLowerV2.J","instOfNatAtLeastTwo","Real.instNatCast","Nat.instAtLeastTwoHAddOfNat","Nat.instNeZeroSucc","RiffleLowerV2.gridTime","HAdd.hAdd","instHAdd","instAddNat","HMul.hMul","instHMul","Real.instMul","HSub.hSub","instHSub","Real.instSub","Real.log","Nat.cast","And.intro"],"value":"fun {k N K : ℕ} (cuts : TimeProfile.Cuts k N K) (hN : 0 < N) {mu bl : ℕ}\n    (motive :\n      0 ≤ RiffleLowerV2.J cuts hN 2 (RiffleLowerV2.gridTime N mu) (RiffleLowerV2.gridTime N (mu + bl)) ∧\n          RiffleLowerV2.J cuts hN 2 (RiffleLowerV2.gridTime N mu) (RiffleLowerV2.gridTime N (mu + bl)) ≤\n            (R